      "artist": "RichTea",
      "description": "Bedford roofscape, Allhallows (5). From the top of the Allhallows car park, we can see the tops of buildings on each side of Allhallows. The gap between the buildings, just beyond the trees is Church Square. The highest part at the top let is Debenhams. Behind the spire of St Paul's Church is Park Inn hotel (originally built in the 1960's as he County Hotel). \nFor a view to the left of this one see 1375103\n\nFor a view to the right of this one see1375112",
